OL,3,CPolice issue CCTV appeal after woman
OL,4,Csexually assaulted in Islington
OL,6,FWatch: Police have released CCTV
OL,7,Ffootage to help identify a man after a
OL,8,Fwoman was sexually assaulted in
OL,9,FIslington.
OL,11,FPolice are searching for the man who
OL,12,Fphysically and sexually assaulted a
OL,13,Fyoung woman in Islington.
OL,15,FAt around 3am on Friday 4th June, a
OL,16,Fwoman in her early 20s was approached
OL,17,Fby an unknown man in the Essex Road
OL,18,Fand Northchurch Road area.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/6
