PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785172726
OL,3,CPolice issue CCTV appeal after woman
OL,4,Csexually assaulted in Islington
OL,6,FHe began harassing her before dragging
OL,7,Fher into the entrance of a building on
OL,8,FNorthchurch road, where he physically
OL,9,Fand sexually assaulted her.
OL,11,FThe suspect then fled in the direction
OL,12,Fof Angel, he is believed to have
OL,13,Fbriefly attended a nearby shop on
OL,14,FEssex Road.
OL,16,FAfter he fled, two members of the
OL,17,Fpublic heard the woman shouting for
OL,18,Fhelp and came to her aid.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
