OL,3,CPolice issue CCTV appeal after woman
OL,4,Csexually assaulted in Islington
OL,6,FThe suspected attacker is described as
OL,7,Fhaving short hair or a shaved head and
OL,8,Fwas wearing a distinctive tie-dye T-
OL,9,Fshirt featuring blue and pink streaks.
OL,11,FDetective Chief Inspector Paul Ridley,
OL,12,Fwho is leading the investigation said:
OL,14,F"We take reports of this nature
OL,15,Fincredibly seriously and are committed
OL,16,Fto supporting victims and putting
OL,17,Fthose responsible before the courts.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
