CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785172726
OL,3,CPolice issue CCTV appeal after woman
OL,4,Csexually assaulted in Islington
OL,6,F"This was a deeply distressing attack
OL,7,Fon a young woman, which we are
OL,8,Finvestigating as an attempted rape. My
OL,9,Fofficers have been working tirelessly
OL,10,Fto identify the suspect as quickly as
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,13,F"CCTV shows a man fleeing along Essex
OL,14,FRoad, running past a bus stop towards
OL,15,FAngel. There were a number of vehicles
OL,16,Fon the road at that time.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785172726
OL,3,CPolice issue CCTV appeal after woman
OL,4,Csexually assaulted in Islington
OL,6,F"Please get in touch with us if you
OL,7,Frecognise the man or if you have CCTV
OL,8,For dashcam footage that could help our
OL,9,Finvestigation. No piece of information
OL,10,Fis too small, and what may seem
OL,11,Finsignificant to you could prove vital
OL,12,Fto our investigation.
OL,14,F"Two members of the public bravely
OL,15,Fcame to the woman's assistance. While
OL,16,Fofficers have spoken to a woman who
OL,17,Fintervened, we are yet to speak to man
OL,18,Fwho also stepped in.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785172726
OL,3,CPolice issue CCTV appeal after woman
OL,4,Csexually assaulted in Islington
OL,6,F"He is described as a white male in
OL,7,Fhis late teens or early 20s, with an
OL,8,Fathletic build and curly, ash-blonde
OL,9,Fhair.
OL,11,F"I would like to make a direct appeal
OL,12,Fto him to get in touch with officers.
OL,13,FHe may have crucial information to
OL,14,Fsupport the investigation and would
OL,15,Fask that you contact us as soon as
OL,16,Fpossible."
OL,26,@sD@AOUxD@JO]
